@dev The single attestation oracle authorized to call
      `recordAttestation`. Settable by owner so the oracle can be
      rotated without redeploying the queue.

@param initialOwner Owner permitted to set / rotate the oracle.
 @param factory_ The {IndexFactory} whose clones are authorized to
        create intents.
 @param attestationOracle_ Initial AttestationOracle address. May be
        zero at deploy time and set later via {setAttestationOracle},
        but `recordAttestation` reverts until set.
